---
description: OfficialHosts front-end design system and architecture
globs: src/**/*
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before building UI.

- Premium SaaS aesthetic (not generic Bootstrap chrome)
- Gold primary CTAs (`--oh-gold`), emerald for success/savings, navy text
- CSS Modules per component; Bootstrap grid/utilities only
- Mock data in `src/data/mock/`; API placeholders in `src/lib/`
- Marketing pages use `MarketingLayout`; app uses `DashboardLayout`
